EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}All my boxes are so heavy!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Maybe I
shouldn't have filled them with
workout sand{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}But I gotta stuff those punching
bags with something!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Questi scatoloni sono così
pesanti!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Forse non avrei dovuto
metterci tutta quella sabbia{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}... ma dovevo riempire in qualche
modo il mio amato sacco da boxe!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Soll ich dir was verraten?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Manche
meiner Umzugskartons sind bis
zum Rand mit Sand gefüllt!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Wenn ich für den Umzug schon
mein Training unterbrechen muss...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
mach ich eben das Beste daraus!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bütün kutularım çok ağır!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Belki
de içlerini antrenman kumu
doldurmamalıydım{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ama kum torbalarını da bir şeyle
doldurmam lazım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Man, cleaning is taking me all day!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And I'm still not done!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}I sure hope I can finish up early 
tomorrow! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Vaya, ¡llevo todo el día limpiando!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Y me queda muchísimo que hacer!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}¡A lo mejor mañana por la mañana
esto ya está, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Of, temizlik bütün günümü aldı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hâlâ da bitmedi!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Umarım yarın
erkenden bitirebilirim! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
